  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic stimulation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ekonomisk stimulering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic stimulation 2009/10 to support regional development through investment in rural Moldova which has been hit hard by the global financial crisies, and to create employment opportunities Project is with WB and financing through TF.Implementing part is Social Investvestment Fund M, and the contribution takes stock from ongoing project results of SIF2, also financed by WB and Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ekonomisk stimulering under 2009/10 inom sektorn regional development som st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att lindra Moldaviens ekonomiska och finansiella kris. Insatsen &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d i samarbete med WB, och riktar sig framf&#xf6;r allt till investeringar i den lokala infrastrukturen p&#xe5; landsbatt genom skapa arbetstillf&#xe4;llen.Genomf&#xf6;rande partner &#xe4;r MSIF, och vilar p&#xe5; resultaten av MSIF2 som Sida finansierar med WB.</narrative>
  </description>
